Result categories (A14/A17): PASS, FAIL, SKIP, NOT_RUN, INVALID_TEST,
ENVIRONMENT_LIMIT, ERROR. Only PASS counts toward the ready gate; SKIP,
NOT_RUN and ENVIRONMENT_LIMIT never count as PASS.

